                <p class="subtitle">
                    Veeam
                </p>
            
            </div>
            
            </div>

            <div class="description">
        
            Veeam Data Platform is a data resilience platform that helps organizations protect, secure, recover, and move data across hybrid and multicloud environments. The platform unifies backup, recovery, security, storage, portability, observability, orchestration, and compliance capabilities in one solution. Veeam Data Platform helps teams recover clean and fast from outages, cyberattacks, ransomware, storage failures, and other disruption scenarios. Its capabilities include workload mobility, threat detection, data sovereignty, disaster recovery, multicloud protection, governance, risk management, compliance reporting, and AI-powered protection. The platform supports cloud, virtual, physical, application, and unstructured data workloads with freedom to recover across platforms and clouds. Built for enterprises that need trusted data and AI resilience, Veeam Data Platform helps teams reduce lock-in, prove recovery readiness, and keep critical data protected.
    </div>
        </div>

    </div>


