            InEight offers integrated project controls software built for capital construction. The modular platform supports flexible implementation and scales from large, complex projects to billion-dollar capital project portfolios. Purpose-built applications manage every project phase, from pre-planning to predictable execution and completion. By connecting cost, schedule, contracts, and project information in one platform, teams gain real-time visibility and advanced analytics to make smarter decisions. Used in more than 60 countries to manage over $1 trillion in projects, InEight supports industries including mining, nuclear, power and renewables, transportation, water, and oil, gas, and chemical. With InEight, teams improve project delivery, modernize operations, standardize best practices, manage budgets and forecasts, control scope changes, strengthen collaboration, and keep even the most complex capital projects on track.
    </div>
        </div>

    </div>


