                <p class="subtitle">
                    ZipRecruiter
                </p>
            
            </div>
            
            </div>

            <div class="description">
        
            At ZipRecruiter, our mission is to actively connect people to their next great opportunity. ZipRecruiter&#39;s smart matching technology finds candidates with the right skills and experience and prompts them to apply. It uses ZipRecruiter AI to analyze the keywords, skills, experience, and location details in your job description. It then compares this information with the profiles and resumes of millions of job seekers in our database. The system then presents you with candidates whose qualifications are the strongest match, helping you quickly identify top talent. It also sends jobs to 100+ job boards with one click. 

ZipRecruiter provides 24/7 customer support rated highest for quality among major hiring platforms. You can contact us via: Phone, Live Chat or Email. 
ZipRecruiter is the #1-rated hiring site according to G2.
ZipRecruiter delivers quality candidates to 80% of employers within the first day.
ZipRecruiter serves both small businesses and enterprise employers. 
    </div>
